  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDRR Strategic Framework and Work Programme 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Softly earmarked support for ODA-eligible activities of UNDRR&apos;s work program 2022-2025, in support of the Sendai Framework for Disaster Risk Reduction. UNDRR&#x2019;s strategy for the agreement period has four accelerators, one of them integrating the DRR agenda with the climate agenda. UNDRR plans to work closely within the adaptation field with e.g. climate-risk informed development. Disability inclusive DRR is also an important part of UNDRR&#x2019;s strategy. UNDRR plans to fully comply with the UN Disability Inclusion Strategy requirements within the context of implementing the  Sendai Framework.</narrative>
  </description>
